This project includes material adapted, with changes, from UniiChat
(https://github.com/VictorTaelin/uniichat) by Victor Taelin, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- src/compactor.rs: the summary prompt, adapted from UniiChat's compaction
  prompt (prompt.txt and Memory.ts), and the rule of keeping the shortest try
  and cutting the input when the model declines (Memory.build).

That adapted material remains under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy
is in LICENSE-APACHE.

Mnem reads and writes the notebook format of OptMem
(https://github.com/VictorTaelin/OptMem). It re-implements that format from
its documented behaviour and contains no OptMem code.
